 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기&nbsp; 간</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"center\" width=\"391\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"20\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">내&nbsp; 용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"86\" height=\"396\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span> 확인</span>.변경</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기간</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"148\" height=\"396\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3.6(수) 10:00 ~3.8(금) 23:59 [3일간]</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"391\" height=\"396\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 타학부, 타학년, 주/야 수강신청이 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(1학년 교양선택 신청가능)</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 여석이 있는 경우 학생본인이 전산으로 수강신청 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(여석이 있는 강좌의 변경은 제한없음)</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-여석이 없는 경우 2과목 이내로 “수강과목 변경 신청서”에&nbsp; 해당강좌 교수님의 확인후 종합학사행정실에 제출 학부(과) 조교 수강신청처리 </span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 이미 수강신청한 과목 중 삭제할 과목은 학생 본인이 수강신청사이트에서 신청된 과목 직접 삭제하여야 함</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 학기초과학생, 졸업학기생, 복수전공, 부전공생, 교직이수생, 전과생, 편입생, 2월수강신청기간 이후 복학생은 3과목 이상 변경&nbsp; 신청 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 지</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">도교수와 수강상담 및 승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">변</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">경(추가, 삭제)이 가능함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 기초수학, 기초물리학, 기초화학 과목은 1학년 대상자 이외에 수강신청 불가함</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 고급</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">한국어1(LA0283), 고급한국어2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">(LA0284)과목은 외국인 학부생만 수강신청 할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 계약학과 개설 과목은 계약학과생만 신청가능</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" valign=\"center\" width=\"86\" height=\"81\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;폐강.합반.분반과목 수강정정기간</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" valign=\"center\" width=\"148\" height=\"81\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3.13(수) 10:00~</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3.15(금) 18:00 [3일간]</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" valign=\"center\" width=\"391\" height=\"81\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 폐강, 합반, 분반과목에 한하여 수강정정</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- “폐강과목 수강정정 신청서” 작성 후 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">해당 종합</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학사 행정실에 제출</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 1학년 교양 선택 과목 수강신청 사항</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>3월 6일(수)&nbsp; 09:20~9:50, 30분간</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong> </strong>2013학번 1학년이 1학년 교양선택 과목먼저 수강신청 가능. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1학년 교양 선택 과목중 대학생활의이해(LA0306-01) 강좌는 수강정원 120명 중 1학년 70명(3월 6일(화)&nbsp; 09:20~9:50, 30분간) 타학년 50명(3월 6일(수)&nbsp; 10:00~)으로 수강신청 인원 조정함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
